#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:214
msgid ""
"Port ``set_auto_gain()`` to ``gain_db=`` + ``get_gain_db()`` and handle "
"``ValueError`` (:ref:`the auto-gain rework <v2_7_0_autogain>`)."
msgstr ""
"انقل ``set_auto_gain()`` إلى ``gain_db=`` + ``get_gain_db()`` وعالِج "
"``ValueError`` (\\ :ref:`إعادة هيكلة الكسب التلقائي <v2_7_0_autogain>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:216
msgid ""
"Port ``set_auto_exposure()`` to ``exposure_us=`` + ``get_exposure_us()`` "
"(:ref:`the auto-exposure rework <v2_7_0_autoexposure>`)."
msgstr ""
"انقل ``set_auto_exposure()`` إلى ``exposure_us=`` + ``get_exposure_us()`` "
"(\\ :ref:`إعادة هيكلة التعريض التلقائي <v2_7_0_autoexposure>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:218
msgid ""
"Update ``find_displacement()`` to the displacement object and rename FFT "
"framesize constants (:ref:`the find_displacement overhaul "
"<v2_7_0_displacement>`)."
msgstr ""
"حدّث ``find_displacement()`` إلى كائن الإزاحة وأعد تسمية ثوابت حجم إطار FFT "
"(\\ :ref:`إعادة هيكلة find_displacement <v2_7_0_displacement>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:221
msgid ""
"Port ``set_auto_whitebal()`` to ``rgb_gain_db=`` + ``get_rgb_gain_db()`` "
"(:ref:`the white-balance rework <v2_7_0_whitebal>`) and stop checking the "
"return of ``set_hmirror()`` / ``set_vflip()`` (:ref:`the mirror/flip change "
"<v2_7_0_mirror>`)."
msgstr ""
"انقل ``set_auto_whitebal()`` إلى ``rgb_gain_db=`` + ``get_rgb_gain_db()`` "
"(\\ :ref:`إعادة هيكلة موازنة البياض <v2_7_0_whitebal>`\\ ) وتوقّف عن فحص "
"قيمة إرجاع ``set_hmirror()`` / ``set_vflip()`` (\\ :ref:`تغيير "
"الانعكاس/القلب <v2_7_0_mirror>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:225
msgid ""
"Pass a firmware path to the WINC ``fw_*`` tools (:ref:`the WINC tools change"
" <v2_7_0_winc>`)."
msgstr ""
"مرّر مسار برنامج ثابت إلى أدوات WINC ‏\\ ``fw_*`` (\\ :ref:`تغيير أدوات WINC"
" <v2_7_0_winc>`\\ )."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v2.7.0.rst:227
msgid ""
"Pass a 28x28 ``roi`` to ``find_number()`` (:ref:`the find_number change "
"<v2_7_0_findnumber>`) and adjust AprilTag angle math for the flipped "
"``z_rotation()`` sign (:ref:`the z_rotation change <v2_7_0_zrotation>`)."
msgstr ""
"مرّر ``roi`` بحجم 28x28 إلى ``find_number()`` (\\ :ref:`تغيير find_number "
"<v2_7_0_findnumber>`\\ ) واضبط حسابات زاوية AprilTag للإشارة المنقلبة لـ "
"``z_rotation()`` (\\ :ref:`تغيير z_rotation <v2_7_0_zrotation>`\\ )."

